Package: twliConsolidate
Title: Recompute Panel Data Over Taiwan Village Consolidation History
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("twli-consolidation-gis", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: Provides utilities to load a structured crosswalk of Taiwan
    village (li/cun) merge, split, rename and redistribute events, and to
    re-aggregate a long-format panel dataset into Stable Analysis Units so
    that socio-economic variables are comparable across years despite
    administrative boundary changes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    yaml,
    dplyr (>= 1.0),
    tidyr,
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
